From 9d3e652debb577508702de3a5ef2afc79c3886f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bherbruck <brennen.herbruck@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:31:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): a chunkier, shorter, readable origin triad

The origin triads were 1 px GPU lines with small letters, and the
dimmed world Z all but vanished on the dark viewport. They are now also
stroked in screen space (3 px over a 5 px dark outline), shorter (15% of
the model extent, 8 mm floor), with a brighter Z blue, lighter dimming of
the world axes, and larger shadowed axis letters. Shell snapshots move
by the triad.

Fixes #195

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
